			"notes": "## Client keybind\n\nWith the client mod installed, an optional keybind (customizable in Controls, default `H`) shows the item under the cursor in chat. It works in any screen where an item tooltip is displayed — container screens, other mods' GUIs, and item-list overlays such as JEI/REI/EMI — and requires the server to run the mod. The chat output is identical to `/show-item`."
		},
